# ============================================================================
# Gsoft Manager Combo Configuration & Script Block
# Optimized for Eclipse set, Blood Moon set, and Barrows gloves (No Void)
# Failsafes: Disable Swap Delay & Disable Distance Checks Active
# ============================================================================

## [Failsafe & Threshold Parameters]
Disable-Swap-Delay: true
Disable-Distance-Checks: true
Enable-Overhead-Checks: true
Min-Damage-Threshold: 40
Min-Spec-Percent: 50

## [Combo Sequence: AGS / Gmaul Switch & Spec Execution]

# Step 1: Ensure hybrid gear baseline (Eclipse, Blood Moon, Barrows gloves) is equipped
e:Eclipse moon helm|Eclipse moon chestplate|Eclipse moon tassets|Blood moon helm|Blood moon chestplate|Blood moon tassets|Barrows gloves

# Step 2: Swap to Armadyl Godsword (AGS) and activate offensive prayer (Piety) simultaneously
e:Armadyl godsword
p:Piety

# Step 3: Fire the Special Attack when damage threshold & spec energy rules match
spec

# Step 4: Follow-up weapon swap to Granite Maul (Gmaul) for instant burst combo
e:Granite maul

# Step 5: Fire secondary spec if conditions permit, then re-gear or toggle protection
spec
